PREAMBLE: COMMITMENT TO TRANSPARENCY & COMMUNITY TRUST
==============================================================================

SkwelaDabaw is an offline-first student academic and commuter companion built 
for the students and commuters of Davao City.

This source code is made publicly available on GitHub to establish complete 
transparency, foster student trust, enable independent security and privacy 
audits, and invite collaborative peer contributions from the local and global 
developer community.

